cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you reference GYTech PatientSim Pro in educational or research material, cite this software metadata. Licensing is pending owner approval; see LICENSE."
title: "GYTech PatientSim Pro: Advanced Patient Vital Signs Monitor & Defibrillator Simulator"
type: software
version: 1.0.0
authors:
  - name: "GYTech"
abstract: "A browser-based educational patient vital signs monitor and defibrillator simulator with real-time waveforms, multiparameter monitoring, alarms, AED, manual defibrillation, synchronized cardioversion, pacing, CPR, and simulation scenarios. The software is not a medical device and is not clinically validated."
keywords:
  - patient monitoring
  - medical simulation
  - electrocardiography
  - defibrillator
  - AED
  - cardiopulmonary resuscitation
  - medical education
  - JavaScript
